@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Jalankan seed ulang dulu (133 hero, 892 skin, 3 player)
# npx tsx prisma/seed.ts

### 1. Semua hero halaman 1 (default limit 10) -> 200, metadata totalItems 133, totalPages 14
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes

### 2. Pagination page=2&limit=5 -> 200, currentPage 2, totalItems 133
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes?page=2&limit=5

### 3. Search "la" (case-insensitive) -> 200, hanya nama yang mengandung "la"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes?search=la&limit=5

### 4. Filter role=MARKSMAN -> 200, totalItems 20
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes?role=MARKSMAN&limit=5

### 5. Role tidak valid -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes?role=WIZARD

### 6. Detail hero 18 (Layla) -> 200, ada array skins
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes/18

### 7. Hero tidak ada -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes/999

### 8. Create hero tanpa field wajib -> 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hero Tanpa Role" }

### 9. Create hero nama duplikat (Miya) -> 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Miya", "role": "MARKSMAN", "lane": "GOLD", "releaseYear": 2016 }

### 10. Create hero baru -> 201 (harga opsional boleh kosong)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/heroes
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Hero Percobaan", "role": "MAGE", "lane": "MID", "releaseYear": 2026 }

### 11. Semua skin halaman 1 -> 200, metadata totalItems 892
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins

### 12. Filter heroId=18 -> 200, semua skin milik Layla
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins?heroId=18&limit=5

### 13. Filter rarity=GRAND -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins?rarity=GRAND&limit=5

### 14. heroId bukan angka -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins?heroId=abc

### 15. Rarity tidak valid -> 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins?rarity=LEGEND

### 16. Detail skin 1 -> 200, ada objek hero
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins/1

### 17. Skin tidak ada -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/skins/9999
